          <NOTE type="x-studynote">Irnahash: or, the city of Nahash</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="13">And the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="7073">Kenaz</gr>; <gr str="6274">Othniel</gr>, and <gr str="8304">Seraiah</gr>: and the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="6274">Othniel</gr>; <gr str="2867">Hathath</gr>. <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">Hathath…: or, Hathath, and Meonothai, who begat, etc</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="14">And <gr str="4587">Meonothai </gr>
