          <NOTE type="x-studynote">valley: or, inhabitants of the valley</NOTE>
        </DIV>
        <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">Charashim: that is, craftsmen</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15">And the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="3612">Caleb </gr>the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="3312">Jephunneh</gr>; <gr str="5900">Iru</gr>, <gr str="425">Elah</gr>, and <gr str="5277">Naam</gr>: and the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="425">Elah</gr>, even <gr str="7073">Kenaz</gr>. <DIV>
          <NOTE type="x-studynote">even Kenaz: or, Uknaz</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">And the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="3094">Jehaleleel</gr>; <gr str="2128">Ziph</gr>, and <gr str="2129">Ziphah</gr>, <gr str="8493">Tiria</gr>, and <gr str="840">Asareel</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="17">And the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="5834">Ezra </gr>
