        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="39">And they <gr str="3212">went </gr>to the <gr str="3996">entrance </gr>of <gr str="1446">Gedor</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">even</STYLE> to the east <gr str="4217">side </gr>of the <gr str="1516">valley</gr>, to <gr str="1245">seek </gr>
        <gr str="4829">pasture </gr>for their <gr str="6629">flocks</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="40">And they <gr str="4672">found </gr>
        <gr str="8082">rich </gr>
        <gr str="4829">pasture </gr>and <gr str="2896">good</gr>, and the <gr str="776">land </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">was </STYLE>
        <gr str="7342 3027">wide</gr>, and <gr str="8252">quiet</gr>, and <gr str="7961">peaceable</gr>; for <STYLE css="font-style:italic">they</STYLE> of <gr str="2526">Ham </gr>had <gr str="3427">dwelt </gr>there of <gr str="6440">old</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="41">And these <gr str="3789">written </gr>by <gr str="8034">name </gr>
