        <gr str="4829">pasture </gr>there for their <gr str="6629">flocks</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="42">And <STYLE css="font-style:italic">some</STYLE> of them, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">even</STYLE> of the <gr str="1121">sons </gr>of <gr str="8095">Simeon</gr>, <gr str="2568">five </gr>
        <gr str="3967">hundred </gr>
        <gr str="582">men</gr>, <gr str="1980">went </gr>to <gr str="2022">mount </gr>
